What are Thermal Transfer Ribbons?
Thermal transfer ribbons are specialized ink-coated films used in thermal printing applications where heat transfers ink onto labels, tags, and packaging materials. These components are categorized into wax, wax-resin, and resin-based formulations, each offering different durability levels for various industrial applications. Their primary function involves creating durable barcodes and product identification that withstand environmental factors across retail, logistics, and manufacturing sectors.

